Comment: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次的委託是什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰知道
Comment: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超有疑問的
Comment: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:16.23,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,叫我們阻止武器交易
