Comment: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總覺得
Comment: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有種奇怪的感覺
Comment: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麥野
Comment: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超沒問題的
Comment: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要嚇我嘛
Comment: 0,0:00:48.89,0:00:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝啦麥野...
Comment: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以測試運轉來說的話 成果還算不錯
Comment: 0,0:00:57.46,0:01:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,朝著主要目標蒐集到越來越多數據...
Comment: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有富
Comment: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.70,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,肚子好撐啊~
Comment: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還是第一次吃到鱉料理呢
Comment: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂帶來的肉也很棒對吧
Comment: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果不小心吃太多了
Comment: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是吃一下藥比較好喔
Comment: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說
Comment: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果跟老師談得怎麼樣?
Comment: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,找到一個不錯的地方喔
Comment: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,終於到了這一天啊
