Comment: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:16.42,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛才那個人是誰呀?
Comment: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:20.58,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,那個很豪爽的人
Comment: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就只是認識的人而已
Comment: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又來了又來了
Comment: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該不會是上次送餅乾的對象吧?
Comment: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才...才不是 才不是
Comment: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:29.70,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,最近老被他纏著覺得很煩啊
Comment: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以妳到底是把餅乾送給誰呀?
Comment: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就說不是...
Comment: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳很慢耶
Comment: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到底在幹什...
Comment: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是啊 那個~
Comment: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看妳看 電梯來了
Comment: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家 走吧走吧
Comment: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好啦 快點快點
Comment: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:48.02,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎...怎麼了嗎? 御坂
Comment: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的
Comment: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好可愛呀~
Comment: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,恭喜妳 枝先
Comment: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,後天就能出院了吧
Comment: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是多虧了大家
Comment: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說好在暑假結束以前
Comment: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定要出院穿上那件制服
Comment: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我才能這麼努力的
Comment: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說 出院之後的事情都規劃好了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,枝先會和春上一起住喔
Comment: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是這樣嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為 我一直都住在研究設施裡的關係
Comment: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然要自己一個人生活太困難了嘛
Comment: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以我才去拜託老師
Comment: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能不能安排我跟絆理住在同一間
Comment: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以又要搬家了呢
Comment: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要不要我們去幫忙啊?
Comment: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒關係啦
Comment: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我和初春已經一起整理好了
Comment: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是喔
Comment: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明天搬家公司就會來了
