Comment: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.95,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,真是見外耶
Comment: 0,0:04:53.95,0:04:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,春上說她還想再跟枝先多聊一下
Comment: 0,0:04:58.01,0:04:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春真是的
Comment: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果有和我說一聲 就可以去幫忙搬家了
