Comment: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,時間差不多了吧
Comment: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼?
Comment: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又是風紀委員的工作?
Comment: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.22,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(914,980)}judgment
Comment: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要去幫忙這次學究會的警備
Comment: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今天是去事前調查的
Comment: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸~~~
Comment: 0,0:05:40.91,0:05:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學級會為什麼會需要警備啊?
Comment: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是這樣啦 佐天
Comment: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是班級的學級會
Comment: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是學園都市研究發表會
Comment: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,簡稱「學究會」
Comment: 0,0:05:56.94,0:06:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,日夜致力於學習的學園都市的學生中
Comment: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給予成績優異者的研究發表場所
Comment: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這就是「學園都市研究發表會」
Comment: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過在這裡
Comment: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所謂的成績並不是指能力的優劣
Comment: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是指學業上的成績
Comment: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說
Comment: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是頭腦聰明者的大霸星祭嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有到那麼盛大啦
Comment: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有很多精心準備的發表和講座之類的
Comment: 0,0:06:28.31,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不是很明白
Comment: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之就是今年開始又多了一個有趣的活動
Comment: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個每年都會舉辦...
Comment: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真假!?
Comment: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的能來幫忙嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是社團學姐們拜託我們的
Comment: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管怎麼說 婚后都不需要...
Comment: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在說什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然是妳們兩個的學姐
Comment: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然也是我的學姐啊
Comment: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且我剛來這不久
Comment: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還沒看過學究會呢
Comment: 0,0:06:58.58,0:06:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這正是個好機會...
Comment: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后!
Comment: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳沒事吧?
Comment: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無禮之人
Comment: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道我可是婚后光子嗎?
Comment: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰來...
Comment: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的包包...
Comment: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,光天化日
Comment: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,眾目睽睽下行此惡行真是不可饒恕
Comment: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像你這種惡黨
Comment: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,即使天容你
Comment: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在下
Comment: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后光子絕對不容赦!!
Comment: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真不愧是婚后
Comment: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,爽快俐落
Comment: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,灣內 泡浮
Comment: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,前面有警備員的值勤室
Comment: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.32,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(927,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請去叫他們過來
Comment: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,馬上去
Comment: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接下來
Comment: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳
Comment: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能打擾一下嗎?
Comment: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我從剛剛就一直在看
Comment: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳是不是稍微做過頭了?
Comment: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算對方是犯罪者
Comment: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像妳這樣隨意使用能力我可不能認同
Comment: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你是哪位啊?
Comment: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,平息事情的方法
Comment: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有很多其他的辦法
Comment: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就如同妳說的
Comment: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,前面有警備員的值勤室
Comment: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:12.07,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(927,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也有監視攝影器
Comment: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你到底想說...
Comment: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,更重要的是
Comment: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳應該要意識到自己令周遭的人陷入險境
Comment: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳沒注意到嗎?
Comment: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次是運氣好 將他一擊打倒
Comment: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果妳失敗的話會怎麼樣呢?
Comment: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被激怒的他
Comment: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許會抓女性或是小孩做人質
Comment: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:41.74,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,說的也是 的確不該隨意使用能力...
Comment: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.16,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,的確有可能喔...
Comment: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來你對自己的能力很有自信
Comment: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能力不是萬能的
Comment: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那...那是
Comment: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請等一下
Comment: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知道你是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但不管怎樣也不用說成這樣...
Comment: 0,0:08:57.88,0:09:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后捕獲了犯人是事實
Comment: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們...
