Comment: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:08.34,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(771,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝...謝謝
Comment: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦?
Comment: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛才那個人去哪裡了?
