Comment: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學究會的事前調查
Comment: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然我知道會場分散在好幾個大學裡
Comment: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是沒想到要走那麼多的路
Comment: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,多虧這樣 我的腿都走直了
Comment: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風紀委員也真夠辛苦的
Comment: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:40.86,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(775,980)}Judgment
Comment: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說回來 初春怎麼樣?
