Comment: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不是特地在等...
Comment: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我沒問題的喔
Comment: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我和春上很早之前就說好了
Comment: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,枝先出院後
Comment: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和春上一起住是最好的了
Comment: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說完全不會感到孤單是騙人的
