Comment: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是這麼想的
Comment: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然
Comment: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們兩個住在一起比較好
