Comment: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,新學期開始後
Comment: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,每天在學校都能見面
Comment: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也是呢
Comment: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好乖好乖
Comment: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐我安心了~
Comment: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天真是的!
Comment: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒問題的
Comment: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
