Comment: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好!
Comment: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超讚的!
Comment: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常適合喔!
Comment: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了
Comment: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,之前妳們兩個留在醫院中談的就是這個啊!
Comment: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為想早點穿給大家看
Comment: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:18.50,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,快啊 姐姐大人
